id "c5f8a50f-d033-5259-86d9-bade982764d7" :question/math-academy-id "q-32000" :question/problem "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ for $f(x)=2\\operatorname{arccsc} (8-{x}^{4}).$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccsc} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} \\,x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the chain rule and the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\operatorname{arccsc} (8-{x}^{4})) \\\\  & =2\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} (8-{x}^{4})) \\\\  & =2\\left(-\\frac{1}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}\\right)\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(8-{x}^{4}) \\\\  & =2\\left(-\\frac{1}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}\\right)\\cdot (-4{x}^{3}) \\\\  & =\\frac{8{x}^{3}}{|8-{x}^{4}|\\sqrt{(8-{x}^{4})^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186116525 :tutorial/content "We can calculate the derivatives of the inverse reciprocal trigonometric functions by using their definition and the chain rule, similar to how we did for the inverse trigonometric functions. When we do so, we get the following results:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arcsec} x) & =\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x) & =-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}} \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccot} x) & =-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :tutorial/id #uuid "8e9ebe2e-e55f-5d5a-84d8-e4431382a5d4" :tutorial/math-academy-id 458 :tutorial/title "Introduction"}] [{:answer/id #uuid "10117d52-a320-51da-b8e7-1851c6537b64" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} {x}^{3}}{x}-\\frac{3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{6}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244464}] [{:answer/id #uuid "1ab7f9da-7c10-5b2e-8481-c9ddabaa03cb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arccsc} x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244553}] [{:answer/id #uuid "1d6a9bcf-5b72-54d9-a128-8bd6ee36de0a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{2x+4}{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}+\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244573}] [{:answer/id #uuid "3a12daab-bb88-55ce-a334-ad69cb782225" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{x+4}{\\operatorname{arccsc} x}-\\frac{{x}^{2}+4x}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}\\cdot {\\operatorname{arccsc} }^{2}x}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244829}] [{:answer/id #uuid "44ae4a4e-83f2-5fd1-80a3-1c8886737842" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{{x}^{2}-4(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244919}] [{:answer/id #uuid "499ffb5c-b83a-58d5-90b9-0e51e6c92cae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} 3{x}^{2}}{x}-\\frac{{x}^{3}\\operatorname{ln}⁡x}{1+{x}^{3}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244970}] [{:answer/id #uuid "50c772b1-d6c2-5511-ae8d-6c9519e53b12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x+\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{{x}^{2}\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186245031}] [{:answer/id #uuid "54eb934b-2ffa-5765-b678-1ac5e7064ec2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{x-(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{2}(1-{x}^{2})}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186245060}] [{:answer/id #uuid "5b3744b3-c954-58b2-9c58-4407b5d13c00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{2x+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186245112}] [{:answer/id #uuid "72f3c284-9daf-518f-a212-1bfdfb0d4b58" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot