ne to the curve $f(x)=-7\\operatorname{arccsc} x$ at $x=\\sqrt{5}.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccsc} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(-7\\operatorname{arccsc} x) \\\\  & =-7\\cdot \\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the slope of the tangent line to the curve $y=f(x)$ at $x=\\sqrt{5}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(\\sqrt{5}) & =\\frac{7}{|\\sqrt{5}|\\sqrt{{\\sqrt{5}}^{2}-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{\\sqrt{5}\\sqrt{5-1}} \\\\  & =\\frac{7}{2\\sqrt{5}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186247133 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "003b3e3a-219a-5a63-82f9-e114c9b4d37e" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244302} {:answer/id #uuid "7bfce65e-8edd-5eb9-8109-7bfded382ddb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186245400} {:answer/id #uuid "cb129f6f-8bae-5b10-9445-3a48d828ffb5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}+1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186246123} {:answer/id #uuid "e424bc2c-c9b0-54ec-ac45-cdf316570410" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2x}}+\\frac{2}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186246342} {:answer/id #uuid "f1d60c5c-939e-553d-8a88-0311bdb31b96" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186246447}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186246447} :answer-field/id #uuid "f0f6b5ea-57a6-5c54-8af0-7276b65f1d99" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186246978}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "df356eaf-6e61-57d5-a6b9-0f0386234268" :question/math-academy-id "q-110517" :question/problem "Calculate ${f}^{′}(x)$ if $f(x)=2\\sqrt{x}+5\\operatorname{arccsc} x.$" :question/worked-solution "The formula for the derivative of $\\operatorname{arccsc} $ is\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x)=-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\n$$\n\nUsing the formula above, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & =\\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(2\\sqrt{x}+5\\operatorname{arccsc} x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+5\\cdot \\frac{\\text{d}}{\\text{d}x}(\\operatorname{arccsc} x) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}+5\\left(-\\frac{1}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}\\right) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}-\\frac{5}{|x|\\sqrt{{x}^{2}-1}}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186247164 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "44ae4a4e-83f2-5fd1-80a3-1c8886737842" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{{x}^{2}-4(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244919} {:answer/id #uuid "54eb934b-2ffa-5765-b678-1ac5e7064ec2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{x-(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{2}(1-{x}^{2})}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186245060} {:answer/id #uuid "5b3744b3-c954-58b2-9c58-4407b5d13c00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{2x+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186245112} {:answer/id #uuid "b7b4864f-e9c0-561f-967a-e58924dd458a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186245953} {:answer/id #uuid "f4f040b6-a6e9-51c2-a70e-f9e708728537" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\frac{2x+3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1-{x}^{2})}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186246475}] :answer-field/correct {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186245953} :answer-field/id #uuid "9717ab3e-0ab6-5407-ba6f-0013f2497acb" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186246810}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487} :question/id #uuid "d426c97a-392b-5a03-bca2-ec79aac9b21d" :question/math-academy-id "q-110786" :question/problem "Calculate $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}$ for $y=\\frac{\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{3}}.$" :question/worked-solution "Here, we let $u(x)=\\operatorname{arccot} x$ and $v(x)={x}^{3},$ and apply the quotient rule.\n\nWe use the formulae\n\n$$\n{u}^{′}(x)=-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{and}\\,{v}^{′}(x)=3{x}^{2}.\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =\\frac{{u}^{′}(x)\\cdot v(x)-u(x)\\cdot {v}^{′}(x)}{[v(x)]^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}}\\cdot {x}^{3}-\\operatorname{arccot} x\\cdot 3{x}^{2}}{({x}^{3})^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{-\\frac{{x}^{3}}{1+{x}^{2}}-3{x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{\\left(\\frac{{x}^{3}+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{1+{x}^{2}}\\right)}{{x}^{6}} \\\\  & =-\\frac{{x}^{3}+3(1+{x}^{2}){x}^{2}\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{6}(1+{x}^{2})} \\\\  & =-\\frac{x+3(1+{x}^{2})\\operatorname{arccot} x}{{x}^{4}(1+{x}^{2})}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186247165 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1ab7f9da-7c10-5b2e-8481-c9ddabaa03cb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arccsc} x\\cdot \\operatorname{cos}⁡x-\\frac{\\operatorname{sin}⁡x}{x\\sqrt{{x}^{4}-1}}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186244553} {:answer/id #uuid "50c772b1-d6c2-5511-ae8d-6c9519e53b12" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498} :answer/value "\\operatorname{arccsc} {x}^{2}\\cdot \\operator